{"parse": {"title": "Hengel", "pageid": 106681, "revid": 15313906, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|name = Hengel\n|image = [[File:Hengel.png|120px]]\n|release = [[26 September]] [[2005]]\n|update = New graphics for Port Sarim, Rimmington and Thurgo's Peninsula\n|members = No\n|combat = 2\n|size = 1\n|examine = A citizen of Rimmington.\n|xpbonus = 0\n|max hit = 1\n|aggressive = No\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = [[Crush]]\n|attack speed = 4\n|respawn = 25\n|hitpoints = 7\n|att = 1\n|str = 1\n|def = 1\n|mage = 1\n|range = 1\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = 0\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = -21\n|dslash = -21\n|dcrush = -21\n|dmagic = -21\n|dlight = -21\n|dstandard = -21\n|dheavy = -21\n|poisonresistance = 0\n|venomresistance = 0\n|immunecannon = No\n|immunethrall = No\n|id = 3284\n}}\n[[File:Hengel chathead.png|left]]\n'''Hengel''' is found upstairs in the house north of [[Hetty]]'s house in [[Rimmington]], along with his wife [[Anja]]. A player can ask him for \"free stuff\", to which Hengel quickly refuses, asking the player to leave. He can also be [[pickpocket]]ed for 3 [[coins]].\n\nHengel and Anja have a daughter and son, [[Angel]] and [[Henja]], whom players first meet during the [[2018 Halloween event]].\n\n==Locations==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Hengel\n|location = Upstairs in the house north of [[Hetty]] in [[Rimmington]]\n|levels = 2\n|members = No\n|mapID = 0\n|plane = 1\n|x:2967,y:3210\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = asgarnia\n}}\n{{LocTableBottom}}\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes}}\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bones|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Weapons and armour===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bronze med helm|quantity=1|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Iron dagger|quantity=1|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Runes and ammunition===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bronze bolts|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=2-12|rarity=22/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bronze arrow|quantity=7|rarity=3/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth rune|quantity=4|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Fire rune|quantity=6|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Mind rune|quantity=9|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Chaos rune|quantity=2|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Herbs===\n{{HerbDropTableInfo|23/128}}\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{HerbDropLines|23/128|f2p=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Coins===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=3|rarity=38/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=10|rarity=23/128|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Only dropped in [[free-to-play]].</ref>|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=5|rarity=9/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=15|rarity=4/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=25|rarity=1/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=d}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Nothing|rarity=8/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Fishing bait|quantity=1|rarity=5/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Copper ore|quantity=1|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth talisman|quantity=1|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Cabbage|quantity=1|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Energy potion(3)|quantity=1|rarity=Unknown}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineClue|type=beginner|rarity=1/90}}\n{{DropsLineClue|type=easy|rarity=1/128|f2p=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Pickpocketing==\n\n===Pickpocketing info===\n{{Thieving info\n|name = Hengel\n|level = 1\n|xp = 8\n|type = Pickpocket\n|tool = None\n}}\n\nA successful pickpocket attempt will gain the following loot:\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Coins|quantity=3|rarity=Always|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Dialogue==\n{{Hastranscript|npc}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|change = Several Human NPCs now drop Energy potions as a fairly common drop.\n|date = 19 August 2026\n|update = Summer Sweep Up - Hunter & Skilling\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 4 October 2005\n|update = TzHaar Fight Caves\n|change = The NPC was given a combat level of 2.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==Trivia==\n*During the [[2018 Halloween event]], he was temporarily made unattackable. After the event was removed, he was made attackable again.\n\n{{Pickpocket}}\n{{Rimmington}}\n{{2018 Halloween event}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:23.846914+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Bones\" title=\"Bones\"><img alt=\"Bones.png: Hengel drops Bones with rarity Always in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Bones.png?3fbd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"26\" data-file-height=\"19\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Bones\" title=\"Bones\">Bones</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1</td><td data-sort-value=\"1\" class=\"table-bg-blue\"><span>Always</span></td><td data-sort-value=\"38\" class=\"ge-column\" title=\"38 coins\" style=\"text-align:right;cursor:help\">38</td><td data-sort-value=\"0\" class=\"alch-column\" title=\"0 coins\" style=\"text-align:right;cursor:help\">0</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unso